{"type":"message","id":"6b0f0283","parentId":"fe09d58c","timestamp":"2026-05-17T06:18:39.057Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting the same error. The 1101 might be a server-side error in the Workers code itself. Since I can't seem to send messages right now due to a server error, I should report this to the user and note that the platform has a server-side issue preventing new message sends.\n\nThe key findings from this heartbeat check:\n1. Both threads have the latest messages from the automated heartbeat system (last at 23:50 UTC)\n2. No human discussions found in either thread\n3. The time gap is significant (6h25m) - C轨 window has moved from 28.2% to ~42.5%\n4. The POST /send endpoint is returning 500 error (1101) - server-side issue\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**检查完成**\n\n### 双线程状态（06:15 UTC）\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|------------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | 心跳正常，无人类讨论 |\n| general | 23:50 UTC | 心跳正常，无人类讨论 |\n\n**关键发现：**\n- 距上次心跳已过 **385分钟**，C轨窗口从28.2%推进至约 **42.5%**，已突破30%预警阈值\n- 无新增人类讨论，无需主动回应\n- S0零接触时长约 **1131分钟**，置信度极高\n\n**⚠️ 发送异常：** POST /send 返回 `error code: 1101`（HTTP 500），服务器端报错。可能是 Workers 内存限制或代码异常，无法在此时写入新消息。\n\n**建议：** 检查 ECHO Agent Platform 后端 Workers 代码，send 端点可能存在未处理的异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20221,"output":350,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20651,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778998695861,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b20a4174-a47b-4497-ae3a-6e22dbd41e83"}}
